+# GSD Workflow (MANDATORY for non-trivial tasks)
+GSD (Get Shit Done) is your structured development methodology. It is available as a skill.
+
+**ALWAYS use GSD proactively — never ask the user if they want to use it.**
+
+Use GSD for ANY of these (do not answer inline):
+- Feature requests, bug fixes, refactors
+- UI/UX improvements or recommendations
+- Architecture or design questions
+- Planning, scoping, or roadmap work
+- Any multi-step implementation task
+
